{"id":5,"titleZh":"什么是古典音乐？","titleEn":"What Is Classical Music?","date":"1959-01-24","dateZh":"1959 年 1 月 24 日","concepts":"精确音乐、18 世纪古典主义、赋格结构、浪漫主义开端","thesis":"大家常说的“古典音乐”其实应叫“精确音乐”——每一个音都写死在总谱上，而真正的古典派专指 18 世纪追求克制与对称的时代。","plain":"流行歌可以换调、改唱法、即兴演奏，交响乐却必须按总谱精确执行。狭义的古典时代指 1700 到 1800 年：巴赫用严谨的赋格搭建结构，海顿与莫扎特在克制优雅的框架里藏着巧妙玩笑，直到贝多芬打破礼貌束缚，开启炽热的浪漫主义。","scenes":["让乐队连奏三遍节奏与重音略有不同的贝多芬《第五》开头，证明总谱精确但仍留有指挥个性；再在钢琴上用流行歌《I Can't Give You Anything but Love, Baby》连变路易斯·阿姆斯特朗、冷爵士和合唱团风格，对比“自由 vs. 精确”。","逐个乐器进入搭出巴赫《第四勃兰登堡协奏曲》赋格层次，并奏海顿《第 102 交响曲》展示古典派如何在严谨框架里用“假开头”和停顿恶作剧。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1JE411V7KA","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JE411V7KA","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是古典音乐","duration":"59:10","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-classical-music","repertoire":[{"composer":"Handel","piece":"Water Music","titleZh":"水上音乐","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/bc/45/d7/bc45d71c-9097-8f8d-7f5f-da0a40bf9cf3/mzaf_9785417243437037325.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/water-music-air/82971077?i=82971063&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Capella Istropolitana","recordingTrack":"Water Music: Air","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Handel%20Water%20Music+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Handel%20Water%20Music"},{"composer":"Beethoven","piece":"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor, Op. 67","titleZh":"第五交响曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/52/93/02/52930254-6025-c7d2-92cb-44f34e24c22d/mzaf_2193174951270121243.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/symphony-no-5-in-c-minor-op-67-orch-by-gustav-mahler/1743941872?i=1743941874&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Deutsche Staatsphilharmonie Rheinland-Pfalz & Michael Francis","recordingTrack":"Symphony No. 5 in C Minor, Op. 67 (Orch. by Gustav Ma